  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Thinly slice cucumber into half-moons.\n• Thinly slice red radish.\n• Slice avocado in half, scoop out flesh and roughly chop.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f83ae6cade9b9f0acdd9d4/step-abceb000.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat with enough olive oil to cover the base.\n• Cook plant-based crumbed chicken, until golden and heated through, 2-3 minutes on each side.\n• Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f83ae6cade9b9f0acdd9d4/step-99f0f210.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Make the salad Meanwhile, in a large bowl, combine cucumber, radish, avocado, deluxe salad mix and a drizzle of olive oil and vinegar. Season with salt and pepper to taste.\n• Microwave mini flourtortillas on a microwave-safe plate in 10 second bursts until warmed through.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f83ae6cade9b9f0acdd9d4/step-6f886520.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Slice chick’n.\n• Spread tortilla bases with some of the smokey aioli.\n• Fill each tortilla with cucumber salad and crunchy chick’n.\n• Drizzle tacos with remaining smokey aioli to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f83ae6cade9b9f0acdd9d4/step-1795b030.jpg"
    }
  ]
